WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,560
This is Qingyuan Academy

2
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,560
You will go to the Academic Affairs Office to report later.

3
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,560
The Academic Affairs Office will base your examination results on

4
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,360
Allocate dormitories and classes to you

5
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:15,760
If you have any other questions

6
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:17,160
You can also ask there

7
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:31,830
Did I read that right?

8
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:33,630
Lin Da joked and hugged the boy

9
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,230
And it was Lin Daxi who took the initiative.

10
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:37,030
Who said it was just a reunion of old classmates?

11
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,430
This is an ordinary classmate

12
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,830
No wonder he kept his distance in the face of all the genius clocks in the school

13
00:00:40,830 --> 00:00:42,230
It turns out that I already believed that I belonged to someone

14
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:43,830
It’s just that this new student will be in school later

15
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:46,030
I'm afraid I'll have to face the hostility of a lot of suitors.

16
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:48,550
Look at Wang Hao's face now

17
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,350
This expression is so interesting

18
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,580
Wang Hao, what a misfortune.

19
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:56,180
I just stepped forward to talk nonsense and was rejected coldly.

20
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,180
I turned around and saw the goddess taking the initiative to hug others.

21
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,580
This blow is too severe

22
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:01,780
I chased for three months

23
00:01:01,780 --> 00:01:03,380
Not even a bunch of smiling faces can escape

24
00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:05,640
Sa Neng can easily guarantee it every year.

25
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:11,900
There is absolutely no way to be kind in this matter
